    "detailed_description": "2020 will go down in history as one of the most disastrous years ever. Everyone alive felt the effects of the events \u2014 whether it was discrimination, politics, Mother Nature or the pandemic. To keep our heads up at Games with Geebs, we felt there was no better way to get through the chaotic times than to laugh at them. That's where The 2020 Trail comes in.<br><br>\u201c[Humor] offers a way of being sane in an insane place.\u201d \u2014 Thomas Kuhlman<br><br>Take a trip down memory lane in this Oregon Trail parody game where you traverse through the calendar year of 2020. Your decisions directly affect your mood and can make you more susceptible to catching the \u2018rona. Don\u2019t forget to stock up on toilet paper!<br><br><strong>Make decisions on how you spend the year</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533600/extras/6080732bfc392cbdf0d0ff41e8f4ad28.poster.avif?t=1649304472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533600/extras/6080732bfc392cbdf0d0ff41e8f4ad28.webm?t=1649304472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533600/extras/6080732bfc392cbdf0d0ff41e8f4ad28.mp4?t=1649304472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Cook, dance, or skate to boost your mood and fend off depression</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533600/extras/26507518c413fc695680c91fd4fbdc35.poster.avif?t=1649304472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1533600/extras/26507518c413fc695680c91fd4fbdc35.webm?t=1649304472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass